    "Generated public/omics bytes were copied and reverified, but remain ignored and regenerated from byte-identical source inputs.",
    "The shared root layout/header/footer use the independently extracted database shell; no analytics scripts are mounted, replacing the original SiteAnalytics guard.",
    "Original app/benchmarks removals of ModelIndex.tsx, domain CSS and LiteratureExplorer/CSS are reflected on this branch.",
    "Package manifests merge baseline static hosting dependencies with original database dependencies; no blog generator dependencies are needed.",
    "Source migration code retains historical URLs in record fields to reproduce original release bytes. Presentation URLs use the new hostname and routes.",
    "Contributor private state, environment files, logs, dependencies and build artifacts are excluded."
  ]
